@startuml
title The chain of stamps — each one vouches for the one before it
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F3EEFB
  BorderColor #7A5BB5
}
skinparam ArrowColor #7A5BB5

component "Stamp 1\n\"step 1 is correct\"" as S1
component "Stamp 2\n\"step 2 is correct\nand stamp 1 was real\"" as S2
component "Stamp 3\n\"step 3 is correct\nand stamp 2 was real\"" as S3
component "...\none stamp per step" as SD
component "Last stamp\n\"my step is correct\nand the stamp before me was real\"" as ST

S1 -right-> S2
S2 -right-> S3
S3 -right-> SD
SD -right-> ST

note bottom of ST
  the checker looks at this stamp only
  if it is genuine, every earlier step was too
  and it stays the same small size
  whether the chain has 3 steps or a million
end note
@enduml
